# Never overwrite silently (specs/002-manage-server-files US3): a name that is taken asks (keep both, replace after a confirmation, skip); a replace
# whose server file changed meanwhile is held as a conflict with both versions intact until the user decides. Run after 04-unknown-outcome.walk
# with the same server and folders (Auto Sync is off by then, so Send is a tap).
# server touch /Documents/report.pdf
size 1404 1872
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeFiles
waitfor folderRow
# report.pdf is in Documents (uploaded by an earlier walk): picking it again asks
tap folderAdd
wait 500
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerTile 0
wait 700
tap pickerTile 1
expect pickerSelection 1 file(s)
tap pickerUpload
waitfor collisionText report.pdf
expect collisionText is already in
shot @OUT@/51-collision.png
# keep both: the proposed name can be edited; here it is taken as it is
tap footerButton 1
waitfor folderKeepBothName
shot @OUT@/52-keep-both-name.png
tap footerButton 1
waitfor dialogText in the queue
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
# the same file once more: replace it (a second confirmation names the file)
tap folderAdd
wait 500
tap choiceRow 0
waitfor pickerPath
tap pickerTile 0
wait 700
tap pickerTile 1
tap pickerUpload
waitfor collisionText report.pdf
tap footerButton 2
waitfor folderReplaceConfirm
expect dialogText Replace "report.pdf" on the server
shot @OUT@/53-replace-confirm.png
tap footerButton 1
waitfor dialogText in the queue
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
shot @OUT@/54-documents-two-pending.png
# Send: the keep-both copy goes; the replace is held because the server file was changed after the reader's listing
tap folderQueue
waitfor queueRow
tap queueSend
waitfor queueRowCaption Conflict
shot @OUT@/55-queue-conflict.png
tap queueRow 1
tap queueResolve
waitfor choiceRow
shot @OUT@/56-conflict-choices.png
# replace anyway: the server version is looked at again and shown before the user confirms
tap choiceRow 1
waitfor dialogText has changed since you last saw it
shot @OUT@/57-replace-anyway-confirm.png
tap footerButton 1
wait 800
tap queueSend
wait 2500
shot @OUT@/58-queue-resolved.png
tap queueBack
wait 500
tap folderQueue
waitfor queueEmpty
shot @OUT@/59-queue-empty.png
tap queueBack
wait 400
